        <h3>Learn more about helping seniors</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Find social, cultural, learning and recreational programs for seniors through the <a href="https://www.ontario.ca/page/find-seniors-active-living-centre-near-you">Seniors Active Living Centre</a> programs.</li>
            <li>Recognize the <a href="https://www.ontario.ca/page/celebrating-seniors-ontario">contributions of seniors</a> in our communities.</li>
            <li>Recognize the signs of <a href="https://www.ontario.ca/page/information-about-elder-abuse">elder abuse</a> and learn what to do if you or someone you know is being abused.</li>
            <li>Browse the <a href="https://www.ontario.ca/page/information-seniors-organizations">grant programs and seminars</a> for organizations that serve seniors.</li>
            <li>Learn how to create <a href="https://www.ontario.ca/page/creating-more-inclusive-ontario-age-friendly-community-planning-guide-municipalities-and-community">age-friendly communities</a>.</li>
            <li>Learn how the <a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/employment-social-development/corporate/seniors/forum.html">federal, provincial and territorial governments</a> work together on issues and projects related to seniors.</li>
            <li>Follow us on <a href="https://www.facebook.com/SeniorsOntario">Facebook</a>, <a href="https://twitter.com/SeniorsON">Twitter</a> and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/ontario-ministry-for-seniors-and-accessibility/">LinkedIn</a>.</li>
